error[E0066]: interface function `default` must take `Self` in a parameter
 --> tests/ui/08-interfaces/declaration/self_only_in_return.cheby:7:6
  |
7 |   fn default() -> Self
  |      ^^^^^^^ `Self` appears in no parameter
  |
  = note: the type that satisfies the interface is found from the arguments, so a function with `Self` only in its result cannot be declared in v1 (§8.1, D-209)
  = help: add a `Self` parameter, or construct values with an ordinary value such as a decoder

